:R-HSA-5173105  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0006493 ;
        rdfs:comment        "O-glycosylation is an important post-translational modification (PTM) required for correct functioning of many proteins (Van den Steen et al. 1998, Moremen et al. 2012). The O-glycosylation of proteins containing thrombospondin type 1 repeat (TSR) domains and O-glycosylation of mucins are currently described here." ;
        rdfs:label          "O-linked glycosylation" ;
        layout:x            "583" ;
